  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Add the olive oil to the ceramic tagine and sauté the chopped onion and minced garlic until softened.",
    "Add the paprika, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, beef broth, and shredded cheese, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the fenugreek leaves and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the tagine with its lid and bake for 25 minutes.",
    "Remove the lid and bake for an additional 5-10 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
